{"id":"730f0de0d5c55c32","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-indexed-product.md","title":"indexed-product","display":"df-indexed-product — indexed-product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-indexed-product","aliases":["57-df-indexed-product"],"display":"df-indexed-product — indexed-product","depends_on":["[[57-df-family]]","[[57-df-set-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-indexed-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-indexed-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indexed-product — indexed-product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"345b732cc7c71af7\" href=\"?note=345b732cc7c71af7\" title=\"57-df-family\">57-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dfefbfbc01cdb9a1\" href=\"?note=dfefbfbc01cdb9a1\" title=\"57-df-set-function\">57-df-set-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 为集合族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"345b732cc7c71af7\" href=\"?note=345b732cc7c71af7\" title=\"57-df-family\">57-df-family</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i\">\\(U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\coloneqq\\{f\\in U^I:\\forall i\\in I\\;f(i)\\in A_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\coloneqq\\{f\\in U^I:\\forall i\\in I\\;f(i)\\in A_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"345b732cc7c71af7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-set-function","status":"resolved","id":"dfefbfbc01cdb9a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-set-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"345b732cc7c71af7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为集合族，见 [[57-df-family]]；$U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(A_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i\\coloneqq\\{f\\in U^I:\\forall i\\in I\\;f(i)\\in A_i\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":565,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbcf27e4396f5d65","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\ne\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$ 见 [[57-df-ultrafilter]]；$X=\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i$ 见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]；$f,g\\in X$。"},{"id":"f71aeba7a1e4b877","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。"},{"id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|$，见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$u\\sim_{\\mathcal U}v$ 见 [[57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]；$[u]_{\\mathcal U}=\\{v\\in D:v\\sim_{\\mathcal U}u\\}$。"},{"id":"2830229fa8f44c6a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为只含常量及有限正元函数符号的一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{Rel}_S=\\varnothing$，结构载体非空。$\\mathcal K$ 为 $S$-结构类；$\\mathrm{Hom}$、子结构、$\\mathrm{UC}$ 及集合族直积分别取 [[57-df-homomorphism]]、[[57-df-substructure]]、[[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-indexed-product]]。$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为任意集合指标结构族，允许 $I=\\varnothing$；$D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|$。下面给出其结构直积解释 $J$；$c$、$f$、$n$ 遍历各自符号类型，$\\vec a\\in D^n$。类表达式用背景 ZFC 的类模式解释；$\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}$ 是类参数上的谓词记号，并不声称真类是集合的元素。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]\n[[57-df-indexed-product]]\n[[57-df-infinite]]\n[[57-df-injective]]\n[[57-df-mgu]]\n[[57-df-natural-number]]\n[[57-df-omega]]\n[[57-df-ordered-pair]]\n[[57-df-partial-function]]\n[[57-df-pow-fin]]\n[[57-df-range]]\n[[57-df-relation-domain]]\n[[57-df-relation-symbol]]\n[[57-df-relation]]\n[[57-df-sequent-rule]]\n[[57-df-set-function]]\n[[57-df-set]]\n[[57-df-total-order]]\n[[57-df-ultrafilter-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-universal-closure]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption